{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17946","headline":"岐山下二首 二 · 韩愈","name":"岐山下二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹穴五色羽，其名爲凤皇。\n昔周有盛德，此鸟鸣高冈。\n和声随祥风，窅窕相飘扬。\n闻者亦何事，但知时俗康。\n自从公旦死，千载閟其光。\n吾君亦勤理，迟尔一来翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}